msgid "Launch"
msgstr "Dobrir"

msgid "Move to the app menu"
msgstr "Installar"

msgid "Move all to the app menu"
msgstr "Installar tot"

msgid "Apps to integrate"
msgstr "Aplicacions d'installar"

msgid "Integrating..."
msgstr "Installacion..."

msgid "AppImage integrated"
msgstr "AppImage installada"

msgid "AppImages integrated"
msgstr "AppImages installadas"

msgid "Already integrated"
msgstr "Ja installada"

msgid "This AppImage is already integrated"
msgstr "Aquesta AppImage es ja installada"

msgid "Version {version} is already integrated"
msgstr "La version {version} es ja installada"

msgid "Built for {arch}; it will not be integrated"
msgstr "Compilada per {arch} ; serà pas installada"

msgid "No AppImage could be integrated"
msgstr "Cap d'AppImage a pas pogut èsser installada"

msgid "None of the selected AppImages can be integrated"
msgstr "Cap de las AppImages seleccionadas pòt èsser installada"

msgid "Integrated {done} of {total}"
msgstr "{done} sus {total} installadas"

msgid "{done} integrated; {remaining} pending"
msgstr "{done} installadas ; {remaining} en espèra"

msgid "Show integrated AppImages outside the default folder"
msgstr "Afichar las AppImages installadas fòra del dossièr per defaut"

msgid ""
"List AppImages that have been integrated into the system menu but are "
"located outside the default folder"
msgstr ""
"Listar las AppImages installadas dins lo menú sistèma mas que se "
"tròban fòra del dossièr per defaut"

msgid "Use executable name for integrated terminal apps"
msgstr ""
"Utilizar lo nom de l'executable per las aplicacions de terminal "
"installadas"

msgid "Installed"
msgstr "Installadas"

msgid ""
"Gear LeverR is not integrated into your desktop yet. Choose how it "
"should be installed and where to keep your AppImages."
msgstr ""
"Gear LeverR es pas encara installat sus vòstre burèu. Causissètz coma "
"l'installar e ont conservar vòstras AppImages."

msgid ""
"Gear LeverR will be removed together with its desktop entry and the "
"application will close. Removing only Gear LeverR keeps the other "
"AppImages integrated."
msgstr ""
"Gear LeverR serà suprimit amb son entrada de menú e l'aplicacion se "
"barrarà. Suprimir sonque Gear LeverR daissa las autras AppImages "
"installadas."

msgid ""
"Gear LeverR is the only integrated AppImage. It will be removed and "
"the application will close."
msgstr ""
"Gear LeverR es la sola AppImage installada. Serà suprimida e "
"l'aplicacion se barrarà."

msgid ""
"This removes all {count} integrated AppImages, including Gear LeverR, "
"and the application will close."
msgstr ""
"Aquò suprimís totas las {count} AppImages installadas, Gear LeverR "
"compresa, e l'aplicacion se barrarà."

msgid ""
"{count} of the selected AppImages have the same name as an app that "
"is already integrated."
msgstr ""
"{count} de las AppImages seleccionadas an lo meteis nom qu'una "
"aplicacion ja installada."
